<Layout title="Drylining Bathgate | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Bathgate. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Bathgate, West Lothian, and the wider EH48 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/bathgate/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Bathgate and West Lothian" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Bathgate</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Bathgate</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Bathgate, West Lothian, and the wider EH48 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Bathgate provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Bathgate (EH48), West Lothian, and the wider area. Experienced with retail developments, new residential estates, and commercial refurbishments in West Lothian's key growth town.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Bathgate</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Bathgate is a historic market town in West Lothian, situated approximately 15 miles north-east of Edinburgh city centre at the intersection of the A801 and A89 roads. The EH48 postcode covers the town centre with its distinctive 18th and 19th-century architecture, the historic Bathgate Hills, and surrounding residential developments. Bathgate has a population of around 16,000 and has undergone significant transformation in recent decades — from its former reputation as a railway engineering hub to its current status as a growing commuter town and commercial centre. The Bathgate Hills Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty adds a unique character to the area, while ongoing residential and commercial development keeps demand for quality drylining services consistently high across the wider West Lothian region.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of period market town properties to new build residential developments and commercial fit-outs along Bathgate's business corridors. We cover the entire EH48 postcode and surrounding West Lothian areas, serving everything from single-room domestic projects in period properties to larger commercial fit-outs. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Bathgate</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Bathgate crew handles everything from period market town property conversions to new build pre-completion drylining — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the EH48 postcode and West Lothian.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Historic property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in Bathgate's listed 18th and 19th-century market town properties</li> <li><strong>New build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for residential developments on the outskirts of Bathgate and surrounding West Lothian areas</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, and hospitality venues along Bathgate town centre and business areas</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, and new build apartments across West Lothian</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties and mixed-use developments in Bathgate and surrounding West Lothian areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Bathgate We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Bathgate town centre (EH48) — High Street, St John's Street, Market Street</li> <li>Bathgate Hills and surrounding countryside</li> <li>Ashfield area (EH48)</li> <li>Blackridge and Newtongrange (EH22) — 10 minutes via A89</li> <li>West Lothian area generally</li> <li>Livingston — 10 minutes via A89</li> <li>Linlithgow — 15 minutes via A89</li> <li>Edinburgh — 20 minutes via A8</li> <li>Bathgate Business Park and commercial areas</li> <li>East Calder and West Lothian villages</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Bathgate Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Bathgate falls under <strong>West Lothian Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre contains numerous Category A, B, and C listed buildings, particularly properties along the High Street and Market Street that are within conservation areas. Internal structural alterations in listed buildings require listed building consent from the council. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a historic market town property to a commercial fit-out in a new build — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Bathgate Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across West Lothian, including Bathgate, Livingston, and Linlithgow. We understand the unique character of Bathgate — from its historic market town centre to the growing residential developments on the town's fringes. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in a historic Scottish burgh with a strong industrial heritage. Whether you need drylining for a period property conversion, a new build project, or a commercial refurbishment, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 20 minutes via A8</li> <li><a href="/areas/livingston/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Livingston</a> — 10 minutes via A89</li> <li><a href="/areas/linlithgow/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Linlithgow</a> — 15 minutes via A89</li> <li><a href="/areas/broxburn/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Broxburn</a> — 10 minutes via A89</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Bathgate Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Bathgate. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Bathgate Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.